  "body": "➡️ If Lumberjack's Axe is ready: 【Fight.】 You get +1 👊 for this attack. For each previous time you have used this ability this round, you get an additional +1 👊 and deal +1 damage (to a maximum of +2 👊 and +2 damage).\n【Forced】 - After you resolve the ➡️ ability on Lumberjack’s Axe for the third time in a round: Exhaust Lumberjack’s Axe. It does not ready during your next upkeep phase.",
